[l_english.EQUIPMENT_MAGICAL_RANGED_HANDGONNE]
Enchanted Gonne (Witchcraft)

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_MAGICAL_RANGED_HANDGONNE_desc]
Let me introduce, the enchanted gonnne, a magnificent creation that combines the wonders of magic and... well, actually, nopony really knows how it works. What the heck is magic doing in a gun anyway? Is it supposed to push the bullet out of the barrel or just help pull the trigger? Or maybe its just there to make the gun look cool. It’s not like it’s going to make a deadly bullet any more deadly. But it’s cool, so who cares?
§g“Maybe convince yourself that magic helps you aim. So you can at least blame Celestia when you miss, or whoever is in charge of all the magic now.”§!

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_MAGICAL_RANGED_HANDGONNE_short]
Enchanted Gonne

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_MAGICAL_RANGED_HANDGONNE]
魔铳 (巫术装备)

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_MAGICAL_RANGED_HANDGONNE_desc]
请允许我为您介绍，魔铳，这是一个结合了魔法奇迹和...好吧，说实话，没有小马真正知道它是如何工作的。他喵的魔法在枪里到底有什么作用？它负责将子弹推出枪管还是只是帮助扣动扳机？或者也许只是为了让枪看起来很酷。它并不会让致命的子弹变得更加致命，但这很酷，所以谁在乎呢？
§g“也许可以说服自己相信魔法帮助了你瞄准。这样当你没击中目标的时候，你至少可以把责任都推给塞拉斯蒂娅，或者不知道是谁现在负责所有的魔法。”§!

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_MAGICAL_RANGED_HANDGONNE_short]
魔铳
